// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>

/ {
    behaviors {
        HRM_L: HRM_L {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HRM_L";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <280>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            require-prior-idle-ms = <175>;
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <5 6 7 8 9 15 16 17 18 19 26 27 28 29 30 31 35 36 37>;
            hold-trigger-on-release;
        };

        HRM_R: HRM_R {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HRM_R";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <280>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            require-prior-idle-ms = <175>;
            hold-trigger-on-release;
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <0 1 2 3 4 10 11 12 13 14 20 21 22 23 24 25 32 33 34>;
        };

        HRM_L_S: HRM_L_S {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HRM_L_S";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <280>;
            flavor = "hold-preferred";
            hold-trigger-on-release;
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <5 6 7 8 9 15 16 17 18 19 26 27 28 29 30 31 35 36 37>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
        };

        HRM_R_S: HRM_R_S {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HRM_R_S";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <280>;
            flavor = "hold-preferred";
            hold-trigger-on-release;
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <0 1 2 3 4 10 11 12 13 14 20 21 22 23 24 25 32 33 34>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
        };
    };

    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        COMBO_BS {
            bindings = <&kp BACKSPACE>;
            key-positions = <6 7>;
        };

        COMBO_DEL {
            bindings = <&kp DEL>;
            key-positions = <7 8>;
        };

        COMBO_TAB {
            bindings = <&kp TAB>;
            key-positions = <1 2>;
        };

        COMBO_ESC {
            bindings = <&kp ESC>;
            key-positions = <2 3>;
        };

        COMBO_EXC {
            bindings = <&kp EXCL>;
            key-positions = <0 10>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        base {
            bindings = <
           &kp Q              &kp W              &kp E                &kp R           &kp T      &kp Y          &kp U           &kp I                 &kp O               &kp P
           &HRM_L LEFT_GUI A  &HRM_L LEFT_ALT S  &HRM_L LEFT_SHIFT D  &HRM_L LCTRL F  &kp G      &kp H          &HRM_R RCTRL J  &HRM_R RIGHT_SHIFT K  &HRM_R RIGHT_ALT L  &HRM_R RIGHT_GUI SEMI
&kp LCTRL  &kp Z              &kp X              &kp C                &kp V           &kp B      &kp N          &kp M           &kp COMMA             &kp DOT             &kp FSLH               &kp APOS
                                                 &trans               &kp SPACE       &kp ESC    &kp BACKSPACE  &kp ENTER       &trans
            >;
        };
    };

    conditional_layers {
        compatible = "zmk,conditional-layers";

        device {
            if-layers = <1 2>;
            then-layer = <3>;
        };
    };
};
